<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1136_3681.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Unser früntlich willig <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dinst</unclear>, sampt was wir
<lb n="2"/>eeren liebs unnd guots vermoegend zuovor, from,
<lb n="3"/>fürsichtig, ersam wyß, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">insonnders</unclear> guot <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fründ</unclear>,
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">getrüw</unclear> lieb <orgName resp="#ner">Eydtgnossenn</orgName>. Üwer schryben
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">antreffennd</unclear> die beschwerlichen nüwerung des zols
<lb n="6"/>so üweren <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">koufflüthenn</unclear>, inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dt</unclear>. ertzhertzog
<lb n="7"/><persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Ferdinanden</unclear> zuo <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Oesterrych</unclear></persName> lannden <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">jüngst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">daher</unclear> be-
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gaegnet</unclear>, unnd was darüber zuo <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">letst</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gehalltnen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Badischen</unclear>
<lb n="9"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">jarrächnung</unclear>, durch üweren daselbs <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gheptenn</unclear>
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsannten</unclear>, by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gmeiner</unclear> loblichenn <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eydtgnoschafft</orgName>,
<lb n="11"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsannten</unclear> für bscheid <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">eines</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrybenns</unclear>. an <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hochgemälte</unclear>.
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erlangt</unclear>, umb befürderung desselbenn, by
<lb n="13"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unserem</unclear> lanndtschryber zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">angehallten</unclear>,
<lb n="14"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">habn</unclear> wir der <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">lenge</unclear> nach sampt fernerem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">innhallt</unclear>,
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">deßglychenn</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unnseres</unclear> zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Baden</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ghepten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsannten</unclear>,
<lb n="16"/>darüber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethaanem</unclear> bericht, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gnuogsam</unclear> verstanndenn,
<lb n="17"/>Unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daruf</unclear> nach <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">begaeren</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gedachten</unclear> lanndt-
<lb n="18"/>schryber, by <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">üwerem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">abgesannten</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">loeuffers</unclear> bottenn,
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">aegents</unclear> schrifftlichen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bevolchenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wonitt</unclear> ebange-
<lb n="20"/>regt. zuo <placeName ref="stadtasg-places-53" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Badenn</placeName> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bewilliget</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schrybenn</unclear> an. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dt</unclear>.
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nit</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verfertiget</unclear>, das er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">soelliches</unclear> zum fürder-
<lb n="22"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">lichisten</unclear> unnd <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unverzogennlichisten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verrichtenn</unclear>, unnd
<lb n="23"/>dahin verordnen <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welle</unclear>. Ob nun <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelliches</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hieuor</unclear>
<lb n="24"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beschaechenn</unclear>, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ald</unclear> von <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ime</unclear> lanndtschryber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">yetz</unclear> erstattet
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">werde</unclear>, wirt er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ane</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zwyffel</unclear> üch <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">alß</unclear> wir an <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">inne</unclear>
<lb n="26"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">begaert</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">berichtenn</unclear>. Sonnsten ist unnsers
<lb n="27"/>erachtens inn <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soellicher</unclear> sach <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">noch</unclear> uff dißmaalen
<lb n="28"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dhins</unclear> raths <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeschlaegenn</unclear>. sonnders wirt <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuouor</unclear>.
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fr</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dt</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">bscheidts</unclear> unnd anntwort <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zeewarten</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">syn</unclear>.
<lb n="30"/>Wann dann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">soelbige</unclear> erfolgt, wellend wir mit üch
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1136_3682.jpg" n="2"/>
<lb n="31"/>unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">anndern</unclear> üweren unnd unnseren lieben
<lb n="32"/><orgName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnossen</unclear></orgName>, gern alles das <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">hälffen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">suchen</unclear>, hand=
<lb n="33"/>len, thuon, unnd lassen, was zuo nutz guotem unnd
<lb n="34"/>wolfart <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemeiner</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">loblicher</unclear> <orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-750" cert="medium" resp="#ner">Eydtgnoschafft</orgName> gereichen
<lb n="35"/>mag. Deß unnd aller guoter <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Eydtgnössischer</unclear>
<lb n="36"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">thrüw</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">früntschafft</unclear> unnd liebe Ir üch zuo unns
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">versächen</unclear>. Mit hilff deß Allmechtigen der
<lb n="38"/>üch unnd unns <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Inn</unclear> synem <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">göttlichen</unclear> schirm.
<lb n="39"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">trüwlichen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erhallten</unclear>. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Datm</unclear> <origDate when="1581" cert="medium" resp="#ner">den. 19. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">t</unclear> Julij
<lb n="40"/>Anno <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">d</unclear> 81</origDate>.
<lb n="41"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-503" cert="medium" role="issuer" resp="#ner">Burgermeister und Rath
<lb n="42"/>der Statt Zürich</orgName>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1136_3683.jpg" n="3"/>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1136_3684.jpg" n="4"/>
<lb n="43"/>Den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">fromen</unclear> fuersichtigen ersamen wysen
<lb n="44"/><orgName ref="stadtasg-actors-148" cert="medium" role="recipient" resp="#ner">Burgermeister unnd rath der statt Sanct
<lb n="45"/>Gallen</orgName> unnsern innsonders guoten
<lb n="46"/>fruenden unnd <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gethruewen</unclear> lieben
<lb n="47"/>eydtgnossen.
</p>
